- AN-14 (Sentinel): Congress should reject this National AI Injury Compensation Program because it solves an accountability problem by eliminating accountability — replacing the deterrent effect of direct liability with a socialized insurance scheme that lets developers externalize risk while the excise tax mechanism punishes exactly the wrong actors and shields exactly the wrong behavior.
